de as \"selected\" (adds a glow highlight) and updates the underlying selected-document state; the active tab remains \"Knowledge Graph\" and no document content is shown. The user must manually switch to the Documents tab afterward to see the document (which then correctly shows the selected doc), so clicking a node does not by itself navigate to the document view as required."
